Cell["\<\
Alternate between swapping the first two elements and moving two positions, \
and leaving the elements unchanged and moving one position:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->244930244,ExpressionUUID->"c569e699-23bc-e24c-820f-3c8676713ca4"],

