    "specialkeywords" -> {}, "tutorialcollectionlinks" -> {}, "index" -> True,
     "label" -> "Eric James Parfitt/ Cyclic Tag Compiler Symbol", "language" -> 
    "en", "paclet" -> "EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler", "status" -> 
    "None", "summary" -> 
    "ObliviousRingMachine [{ step1, step2 , ...}, init, t] gives a list of \
the results of t steps of an oblivious ring machine that starts from the list \
init and uses the step specifications stepi in turn. \
ObliviousRingMachine[step, init, t] uses the single step specification step \
at every step. ObliviousRingMachine[steps, init, t, prop] gives the property \
prop of the evolution. ObliviousRingMachine[steps, init, t , { prop1, prop2 , \
...}] gives a list of the values of the properties propi for each step.", 
    "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> "ObliviousRingMachine", 
